# Slovak toward-hour HALF: "pol deviatej" == half of the ninth == 08:30
# (bare_half_to + toward_hour_12h).  As in Czech, the half names the coming
# hour with a genitive-feminine ordinal agreeing with elided "hodiny", and
# takes no connector.  Citation: Slovník súčasného slovenského jazyka (JULS
# SAV, slovnik.juls.savba.sk), s.v. "pol": "pol siedmej" glossed as 6.30 h.
pol
